c5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-11156ec5-798c-4635-8e8d-9abf2a4ee49c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f2285072-1912-412b-b047-e2ec13946458\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fda99b70-cdc2-42ab-958e-4439c8e92e55\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aeeee85c-d7c1-4e25-bbb3-b5eda6b1e1cc\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-76201186-5f81-4b7a-9654-9e998de2dad3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-352b1fc6-58a7-4828-83df-407fe05ca310\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6e594c3d-6dce-40d6-9e25-650c6da86e72\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-163665d8-6fa5-49e4-b5e1-49876700c478\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-16c1b6c4-5a05-46bf-a1dd-113eede04994\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-690fcd30-2b07-4395-92f5-bd7aac468abb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70f38c22-9fbf-45b9-9535-e5a1a8ca99a6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9b96e57d-4e5e-47a0-bb99-70d18be8c275\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e9435cd7-c3a1-4c79-8714-59f0e36584a1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2e1a63dd-8afb-43e1-994b-0dc9019a6cef\"><b>📢 4월 30일(수) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4c8d0510-2de0-4352-9782-36686077bdba\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-799af341-987d-40e1-9367-79b7ebd31779\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d86aa826-bc60-4cb0-b43b-d098432be410\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-751774f1-94b5-4d4c-8690-31a252a320ea\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-85473122-1082-46d9-a475-5cb8d8d2244b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2788a8bc-75bf-49c7-84c9-e0f2e1276ff2\">- 4/30(수) 12:00 ~ 13:00 경​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2111e2e9-8f00-4647-8d24-afe6cac0eb1b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-527e25d9-037c-4ace-91c2-1901e57e42a9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1decbf86-9243-4eff-8d15-3eea93375dc8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b3d24239-ce42-4421-9482-c7ea4d8d8a6a\">​</span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-09fd45ac-6d6b-4c63-89e7-a8b9b31e5be2\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed5539e9-b17c-4a3a-9aca-95cb1b0ea25c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f1cda252-2917-45e0-b2ed-d0e31239d8d4\">1. 캠페인 하드 38챕터의 특정 유실물을 자연스럽게 획득할 수 있도록 위치를 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4dc4c95-7df9-4083-9d4b-d5b50287af65\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f51f1051-8275-4b81-a459-a803941a327d\">2. 텍스쳐 품질 설정에 따라 UNBREAKABLE SPHERE 이벤트 필드의 일부 연출이 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-84ef7dc9-dbd2-47c3-8e15-bdd6c361a5ef\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-34cb51b2-142b-44ac-a4e4-a6ab1a19c588\">3. 5x5 SUPPLIES 이벤트 화면의 일부 UI 디자인이 특정 상황에서 잘못 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d2037249-fc4a-4ba7-b34e-f89c0272714c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d4585fd1-5499-4982-9a9a-917413ad5168\">4. 신데렐라 - 뷰티풀 미의 스탠딩 모션 중 특정 부위가 어색하게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed27fe3b-6498-483c-bd27-a288d8523314\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-44ac2262-2426-48a4-a310-6cd4ee72ddea\">5. 리틀 머메이드 - 어비스 플라워의 코스튬 픽 화면 중 일부 UI 연출이 어색하게 재생되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e4a8e5e4-732f-4dfe-bfea-ae7b8010ac5d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-968794cc-4d71-43d8-ab2c-74ba9745414b\">6. 일부 언어의 로컬라이징 이슈를 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6668b977-be9a-42b9-810c-e538a11e14ec\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-71993351-d637-4c8f-8c38-2c4f075b8a30\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d9ee71e9-03dd-463f-a9bd-f10b45d6b7eb\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-51e28c72-3368-4087-af71-fe7fed7dec21\">​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f3d971c9-2cb1-4da0-8058-90c938965224\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fbb71a9a-ba89-4e12-8f05-9e4f39617713\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d97fcbef-a7a4-4a23-972f-68c17234bfc7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-29517f54-de8a-4572-82d2-09f95a5738ae\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-525275e4-7c6f-459d-9e2c-9ac9316e19ca\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-256b5856-ec92-47b5-a30d-1a61a602a3a1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7f88df98-9da2-4e65-9e1b-7a1af7b61699\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8f5e2cd2-d2e9-483e-880b-1f81cd5a74e2\">게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-1d789852-39de-4e40-8bec-d9db62069b50\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></scr